# Design sync (HTML ↔ HSK)

Shared chrome is defined here and mirrored in harrix-swiss-knife.

## Checklist when changing colors / buttons / input chrome

1. Edit `src/scss/_variables.scss`
2. Update `.cursor/design-tokens.md` if roles change
3. Update `.cursor/rules/h-brand-colors.mdc`
4. Mirror in HSK: `apps/common/ui_chrome.py`, `.cursor/design-tokens.md`, `.cursor/rules/hsk-ui-chrome.mdc`
5. Run `npm run check`, `npm run check:css`, `npm run build`

## Do not sync

- Navbar height / logo layout (site-only)
- Caption / Win11 window buttons (desktop-only)
- Screenshot overlay `#00AEFF` (desktop-only)
